<!--
  Synthetic C-CDA Problems section. No patient data.

  The narrative table is ordered Problem, Noted Date, Diagnosed Date, so
  reading it by position (name, ICD-10 code, status, onset) stores the noted
  date as the ICD-10 code and the diagnosed date as the status. Each Problem
  Observation sits in its own Problem Concern Act:

    prob-display      SNOMED value with a displayName and an ICD-10-CM
                      translation; onset; an "active" status observation; a
                      severity observation
    prob-original     ICD-10-CM value whose originalText references the
                      narrative cell; the concern is completed, which is
                      not the problem's status (still active)
    prob-abated       onset and abatement (resolved)
    prob-inactive     an "inactive" status observation
    prob-suspended    the concern is suspended (still active)
    prob-code-only    nothing but the SNOMED code names it
    prob-negated      negationInd with SNOMED "problem": no known problems
    prob-unnamed      nothing names it, and its text references its own row

  Every observation but prob-code-only and prob-negated references its row.
-->
